"            </t>\n"
"            <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                När betalningen har bekräftats,\n"
"                <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_total - object.amount_paid - transaction_sudo.amount, object.currency_id) or ''\">$ 10.00</span>\n"
"                återstår att betala.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
